                <div class="heading col-xs-12 col-sm-8 col-md-8">
                    <p class='article__time'>May 26, 2021</p>
                    <h3 class='title'><em>Remarks</em></h3>
                    <p class="speaker">
                        
                        
                                    
                                    
                                    
                                    
                                    
                                    
                                    
                        Vice Chair for Supervision Randal K. Quarles
                    </p> 
                    <p class='location'>At the National Association of Insurance Commissioners International Insurance Forum (via prerecorded video)</p>
